# 🚀 Gold Insight Web App - Feature Enhancement & UX Improvement Plan

> **Goal**: Transform the Gold Insight app into a feature-rich, delightful, and professional-grade gold market analysis platform.

---

## 📊 Current State Assessment

| Aspect | Status | Notes |
|--------|--------|-------|
| **Core AI Analysis** | ✅ Strong | Multi-domain Gemini analysis with 6 trusted sources |
| **Real-time Data** | ✅ Working | Multiple API fallbacks (Metals-API, TradingView, GoldPrice.org) |
| **UI/UX Design** | ⚠️ Good | Modern dark theme, but needs micro-interactions |
| **Features** | ⚠️ Basic | Single asset, no user features, no personalization |
| **Performance** | ⚠️ Adequate | No lazy loading, limited caching |
| **Accessibility** | ❌ Missing | No ARIA labels, keyboard navigation incomplete |

---

